%% A Mermaid flowchart: open the Diagram view (Ctrl+Shift+V)
flowchart LR
  idea([An idea]) --> note[Write it in a note]
  note --> task{Is it a task?}
  task -- yes --> todo["- my task - todo"]
  task -- no --> keep[Keep writing]
  todo -->|Ctrl+Enter| ongoing[ongoing]
  ongoing -->|Ctrl+Enter| done[done]
  done -->|Ctrl+Shift+Enter| archive[(work_done.txt)]
  archive --> report[[Activity report]]
